---
// The Village crisis block, verbatim per Quill's site guidance (Nov 22, 2026).
// Text TALK to 741741 is the Village standard wording.
---

<aside class="crisis-block" aria-label="Crisis support">
  <p class="crisis-block-text">If you or someone you love is struggling: call or text <strong>988</strong> — the Suicide and Crisis Lifeline (U.S., free, 24/7, English and Spanish). Or text <strong>TALK to 741741</strong> for the Crisis Text Line.</p>
  <p class="crisis-actions">
    <a class="crisis-btn" href="tel:988">Call or text 988</a>
    <a class="crisis-btn crisis-btn-alt" href="sms:741741">Text TALK to 741741</a>
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .crisis-block {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-strong-bg);
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin: 3rem 0 0;
  }
  .crisis-block-text {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .crisis-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .crisis-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0.625rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: var(--accent-strong-bg);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .crisis-btn-alt {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-tint);
    color: var(--accent-tint);
  }
</style>
